        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SH10-rules" value="SH10: Each file row has a bundled, extension-appropriate logo immediately before its filename. Known names such as Dockerfile may use their type logo; unrecognized names/extensions retain a generic file icon. Nested and root rows align using a reserved 16 px chevron slot; only folders have chevrons. Folder disclosure uses the 16 px outline Codicon chevron-right/down, replacing filled text triangles. Files/Find/Commits section headers use the same chevrons. No CDN or remote icon fetch. Logos and chevrons are decorative, hidden from assistive naming; button labels remain filenames and folder buttons expose aria-expanded. Long names truncate visually with their full relative path on hover. Selection, nested expansion, bulk controls, width, search, history and read-only behavior stay the same." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#172033;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="390" width="1160" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SH10-checks" value="Transitions: folder click/Enter/Space changes right ↔ down and body visibility without opening a file. File click/Enter selects source and leaves folder expansion intact. Collapse/Open all and hide/restore keep icons aligned and disclosures correct. Verify normal/full-page/small viewport and light/dark contrast against real Skill files; other extension mappings have internal coverage, not fabricated live examples." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#172033;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="552" width="1160" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
